# The app's build-time settings: copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Both default to the loopback
# server that `bun server.ts` starts, so a plain checkout runs with no file at all.

# Where the app finds the Notient server. A phone or another computer needs an address it can
# reach (LAN, VPN or public), not 127.0.0.1.
API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
# The same server's live-update channel (ws:// or wss:// with the same host).
SOCKET_URL=ws://127.0.0.1:8787

# Optional, for `bun server.ts` (the dev API): JWT_SECRET and ENCRYPTION_MASTER_KEY. Left unset, it
# keeps a random pair in .notient-secrets.json beside the database.
